{"id": "official:sentence:ab643fd2-329f-45ef-a7c2-2295aa7bf818", "text": "他昨晚一定是喝多了。", "shortMeaning": "昨晚他准是喝过了量。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:334d2d22-d88a-44b9-a237-d327e52e395a", "text": "他是一个优秀的作家。", "shortMeaning": "他是个很出色的作家。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:bc0ddd18-442a-417c-a372-b4102f72610e", "text": "他是一个体育爱好者。", "shortMeaning": "他爱好体育。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:684c2e66-97a4-44fb-8f51-8f361844ff64", "text": "他是一个有意思的人，脑洞特别大。", "shortMeaning": "他这人有趣，想头特别奇。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:08c501df-2a92-41bd-b50b-cf425fe1ed82", "text": "他是一个正直的人，今后也是。", "shortMeaning": "他为人正派，往后也如此。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:467355a6-329a-455e-b567-ddce6b429293", "text": "他是一个生物学家。", "shortMeaning": "他是搞生物学的。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:0b0edb3f-95ff-4f68-95c5-e0a40aa2039c", "text": "他是一个脑子灵活的人。", "shortMeaning": "他脑筋转得快。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:3c64f486-83f6-474e-8ccd-5a94edbaa6b1", "text": "他是一个衣冠禽兽。", "shortMeaning": "他外表斯文，内里却是畜生。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:f1e40545-d542-4064-950e-e9cd84135732", "text": "他是一个高大的男孩。", "shortMeaning": "他是个高个儿的男孩。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:0c57f613-78a6-4b97-956c-3266315ce17e", "text": "他是一位专职牙医。", "shortMeaning": "他是专门的牙科大夫。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:402d6a5c-2822-4911-bc7f-900738996ee3", "text": "他是一位前无古人的大科学家。", "shortMeaning": "他是位古来未有的大科学家。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:64d51b0e-74b4-4f55-b222-074c137936b1", "text": "他是一位有名的画家。", "shortMeaning": "他是位出名的画家。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:94e386a6-b23d-4aaf-a603-89805c0b88cf", "text": "他是一位脑满肠肥的人物。", "shortMeaning": "他是个肥头大耳的阔人。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:0a2dec21-cca6-4ab0-a74b-a3bf01aa16b1", "text": "他是一位著名的作曲家。", "shortMeaning": "他是有名的作曲人。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:ac1aa264-8bf3-44c9-9733-70548c8fb63e", "text": "他是一名日本商人，但他住在芬兰。", "shortMeaning": "他是日本商人，却住在芬兰。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:fb32f2a1-0ca2-4e31-8a01-c8b938abb1dc", "text": "他是上个学期来的吗？", "shortMeaning": "他是上学期来的吗？", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:8c9068ac-9a30-46e5-b2b1-a8b8d6b36376", "text": "他是不是用铅笔写的？", "shortMeaning": "这字是不是他拿铅笔写的？", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:cc99c39b-060f-4d95-a232-13444e5af8be", "text": "他是世界上最伟大的科学家之一。", "shortMeaning": "世上最伟大的科学家，他是其一。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:b211c146-2ac2-4b21-a511-3692a9ed15a6", "text": "他是两人之中最大的。", "shortMeaning": "两人里他年纪最大。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:56a8aadb-7551-40b0-bd69-7a084c5ac34a", "text": "他是个侍者也是个演员。", "shortMeaning": "他做侍应，也当演员。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:5a148f5b-5109-41cd-9375-d8aaaa3cea09", "text": "他是个受所有人尊敬的科学家。", "shortMeaning": "他是人人都敬重的科学家。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:ac63ca79-af7c-4a9a-bc76-4f6b37bc0ea4", "text": "他是个咄咄逼人的的人。", "shortMeaning": "他这人气势逼人。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:b7d773d8-4000-4205-8ad9-bc56f560efff", "text": "他是个国际银行的翻译。", "shortMeaning": "他在国际银行做翻译。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:4fe7a45c-8c33-45b5-980e-cc0ce7705a2e", "text": "他是个城市规划的专家。", "shortMeaning": "他是搞城市规划的行家。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:93a42b1f-f321-4aca-86b8-2456509e31cc", "text": "他是个天文学专家。", "shortMeaning": "他是天文方面的专家。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:f144d21f-3a82-4c47-bcad-b92f5b12d378", "text": "他是个好脾气的人。", "shortMeaning": "他这人脾气好，好说话。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:3dfcc064-2dd8-4dcc-a7f1-34581a984110", "text": "他是个孤儿，而且不识字。", "shortMeaning": "他没爹没娘，也不认得字。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:643224f2-dfe6-45e7-8f66-5cdafb9198f6", "text": "他是个富有才能的年轻导演。", "shortMeaning": "他是个有才气的年轻导演。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:2cbc2d78-0ab9-4dcf-835e-40fa20ddb9da", "text": "他是个年轻有为的生意人。", "shortMeaning": "他年纪轻，生意做得有起色。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:2993debe-925a-457f-baea-f910084aad67", "text": "他是个很安静的人，头顶有点秃。", "shortMeaning": "他话少，头顶有点秃。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:0cbf2ce4-c9e8-40bd-8d85-d7c79694c239", "text": "他是个很有野心的人。", "shortMeaning": "他心气很高。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:af869f48-310f-4b3c-b052-f871c31b4c58", "text": "他是个很棒的网球选手。", "shortMeaning": "他网球打得极好。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:deb265bf-e921-40f8-823e-88a7c13c6dea", "text": "他是个很难相处的男人。", "shortMeaning": "他这个男人不好相处。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:f51965a6-4e07-4f71-a5cc-a5a64dc6595c", "text": "他是个忠厚老实的人，不免上当。", "shortMeaning": "他厚道老实，难免吃亏上当。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:b28147e0-5742-49c2-a8c4-c72ba2f24ef4", "text": "他是个念旧的人，很多东西都舍不得扔掉。", "shortMeaning": "他念旧，许多东西都舍不得丢。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:0da50ffc-4f8f-4904-88e9-890fc0627a36", "text": "他是个成功的商人。", "shortMeaning": "他做生意做得成。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:ca858d70-08b0-4c7e-88c6-3c2c94908728", "text": "他是个无可救药的家伙。", "shortMeaning": "他这人是没治了。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:56c8fa46-2c39-4493-9a5f-6a04a25274b0", "text": "他是个有为的青年。", "shortMeaning": "他是个有出息的青年。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:d22b6f4c-a210-4642-8c6e-dfbf67bf3037", "text": "他是个有教养的人。", "shortMeaning": "他受过好的教养。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:1e82d545-c20f-412b-9dfc-0016ddb806e5", "text": "他是个极其自私自利的人。", "shortMeaning": "他凡事只顾自己。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:ec177803-7499-4db7-9502-dbfc17dbc8d6", "text": "他是个独立思考者。", "shortMeaning": "他凡事自己拿主意。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:86444c68-6c7e-419e-83f8-5467c3fa69ab", "text": "他是个画家，但他不会画国画。", "shortMeaning": "他是画画的，却画不来国画。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:30c07c95-49f4-4938-b3d9-019f43feb2f8", "text": "他是个直截了当的人，说得到，做得到。", "shortMeaning": "他直来直去，说得出就做得到。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:697f480d-3392-41b5-bbcd-16928887f8df", "text": "他是个绝对不会偷工减料的人。", "shortMeaning": "他干活从不减料省工。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:97aeee83-e97d-4967-8a28-ef20ad5faf71", "text": "他是个老练的侦查员。", "shortMeaning": "他是个老手侦探。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:fb1b0159-77f2-4cb3-984e-c57c46e522f6", "text": "他是个聪明的少年。", "shortMeaning": "他这少年很机灵。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:846295b8-0662-4111-be93-4eac23518904", "text": "他是个能干的男人。", "shortMeaning": "他是个有本事的男人。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:f26b30ad-715c-45c1-87ba-482631e96de7", "text": "他是个自由意志主义者。", "shortMeaning": "他信自由意志那一套。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:aa38cee5-f9bf-461a-bfa5-01d74c759e05", "text": "他是个迷人的发言人。", "shortMeaning": "他这发言人很能打动人。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:a7c19376-03a1-48a3-ba81-1817ddc390bd", "text": "他是个通情达理的人。", "shortMeaning": "他这人很讲道理。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:dea7ee57-5c01-41b8-a245-da6ffe557b21", "text": "他是个非常老实的小伙子。", "shortMeaning": "他这小伙子极本分。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:fbd2576f-9720-401c-ac1c-f2aca6ca1dd8", "text": "他是个音乐家之类的人。", "shortMeaning": "他算个搞音乐的。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:baf17395-c55c-4861-8a31-4c1099c5058a", "text": "他是什么样子的男人啊？", "shortMeaning": "他是怎样一个男人呢？", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:83361cb1-be16-4214-a850-6db6703b7784", "text": "他是从哪里抄来这本书的？", "shortMeaning": "这本书他是从哪儿抄来的？", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:7ed29ae8-e6ad-45fa-b82c-f0e06736dd41", "text": "他是位出色的作家。", "shortMeaning": "他文笔出众。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:ba14d9ab-1af6-4d96-a426-1f4aa5397870", "text": "他是位有名的歌手。", "shortMeaning": "他是有名气的歌手。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:dd24e237-c962-4a2e-80e7-98d79bb47f6d", "text": "他是位有名的白案师傅。", "shortMeaning": "他是做面点的名厨。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:1726e6b2-8db3-4532-a8ac-d8926350623a", "text": "他是你前些时候见过的那个人。", "shortMeaning": "他就是你前阵子见过的那人。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:37dd6a56-1aba-45b1-b29d-35506186e08b", "text": "他是倒数第三个到的。", "shortMeaning": "他到的时候排倒数第三。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:915ef542-f583-4857-b6fb-07f10743ceaa", "text": "他是典型的日本人。", "shortMeaning": "他是地道的日本人。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:3d5e4828-7cdb-45fc-a15e-0ca877f42612", "text": "他是前几天和你见过面的那个人。", "shortMeaning": "他前几天跟你见过。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:c449dc02-97e6-4f5e-9c15-166ef43d42cc", "text": "他是古今无匹的伟大政治家。", "shortMeaning": "他是古今无双的大政治家。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:180df5f0-7acd-4feb-9a2a-1fe41f7323be", "text": "他是哈佛大学的生物学教授。", "shortMeaning": "他在哈佛教生物学，是教授。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:7c598e88-0bf4-4081-b2bd-413c3940b3d0", "text": "他是因为不想一个人待着。", "shortMeaning": "他是怕独自待着。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:37c92a41-d9af-4ee5-841b-e30e5c6936b6", "text": "他是国立大学的一名教授。", "shortMeaning": "他在国立大学当教授。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:02b3d5ae-9234-483c-8afc-4570c38f5331", "text": "他是土生土长的苏格兰人。", "shortMeaning": "他是苏格兰本地人。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:8afd8609-06a0-4bca-a480-64d8b370f354", "text": "他是在我之后到达的。", "shortMeaning": "他比我晚到。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:8c85bac4-ec54-496c-8f41-913c0d3c0f5b", "text": "他是在战争中受伤的。", "shortMeaning": "他的伤是打仗时落下的。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:5af3f799-43bc-4815-8beb-9cb02febc0a4", "text": "他是在生的最伟大的艺术家。", "shortMeaning": "他是当今最伟大的艺术家。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:05ba52aa-81df-4467-b851-86737cefba65", "text": "他是在网上发现这个信息的。", "shortMeaning": "这消息他是在网上看到的。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:df26626a-655b-4f51-8456-7cd8f55045a6", "text": "他是在这里教书的最年轻的教师。", "shortMeaning": "在这儿教书的老师里他最年轻。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:8f02e401-dec7-4a9d-ac2e-00f780e00e83", "text": "他是多么幸运的人啊！", "shortMeaning": "他这人运气真好！", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:7961124d-329a-4570-8089-8ddcf10c3f41", "text": "他是多傻的一个男孩啊！", "shortMeaning": "这男孩傻得可以！", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:ace31f61-0d5f-46ec-b0d9-e965ccbc96f4", "text": "他是天才这件事人人皆知。", "shortMeaning": "他是天才，人人都知道。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:9210f533-236d-4542-9a4e-20bf018237e5", "text": "他是对我感兴趣的。", "shortMeaning": "他对我有意思。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:744dcf1f-7c96-4890-ad12-b74da3b847cd", "text": "他是我们四人中间最年轻的。", "shortMeaning": "我们四人里他最小。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:3cd3f8a1-5b26-4374-bd0e-dac134f0108a", "text": "他是我们所谓的实干家。", "shortMeaning": "我们说的实干家就是他。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:a5deb597-d06f-4d58-a57e-6152905b9749", "text": "他是我们班里的秀才。", "shortMeaning": "他是我们班上的读书尖子。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:f657b00a-9217-46ba-9e77-294977609f1c", "text": "他是我们队上最优秀的选手。", "shortMeaning": "队里数他本事最好。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:46d9da63-3a54-4759-be7b-965b947ef9d5", "text": "他是我太太认识的一个人。", "shortMeaning": "他是我太太认识的。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:268b8870-7a5a-4bcd-acfb-a99212508f1b", "text": "他是我最年轻的兄弟。", "shortMeaning": "他是我最小的兄弟。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:62dc925f-2368-429c-b58f-ec5ea65f18c7", "text": "他是我的如意郎君。", "shortMeaning": "他是我心上称意的丈夫。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:02f41204-f03b-4bfb-8315-60fd5acd3a1d", "text": "他是我的救命恩人。", "shortMeaning": "他救过我的命。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:472a7e1f-7683-4505-9103-058a0e5962f3", "text": "他是我见过最小气的家伙。", "shortMeaning": "我见过的人里数他最抠。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:630bd9eb-1921-45f0-98bf-7f41e318a2b7", "text": "他是我见过的最高的男人了。", "shortMeaning": "我见过的高个男人里数他最高。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:7b0ce3b1-b62a-4f45-8ab0-830c2c425001", "text": "他是排队的第一个。", "shortMeaning": "排队时他站在最前头。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:db04813e-1acd-4068-abe7-857b26d17051", "text": "他是数学系的导师。", "shortMeaning": "他在数学系带学生。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:9f2dc00f-a965-4418-8283-3f86ea7597b5", "text": "他是日本最伟大的艺术家之一。", "shortMeaning": "日本最伟大的艺术家里有他。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:ce79206f-812d-48c2-9f97-e165db688f99", "text": "他是日本最忙的首脑。", "shortMeaning": "日本的首脑里数他最忙。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:726a6bb4-d874-4fe7-a917-e323a83a8b16", "text": "他是日本最有名的歌手之一。", "shortMeaning": "日本最有名的歌手里有他一个。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:0a059c39-7529-4c2a-a3e8-29f72b67487a", "text": "他是日本著名的流行歌手。", "shortMeaning": "他是日本有名的流行歌手。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:c6c88811-cf45-4a86-b487-460768e13c71", "text": "他是时代杂志的记者。", "shortMeaning": "他在时代杂志做记者。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:08d26354-48f9-412e-a2fd-0a421ad0d105", "text": "他是最后一个偷东西的人。", "shortMeaning": "偷东西这种事他最不会做。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:79d3d9b9-389c-4224-9050-72e2f1ba919f", "text": "他是最后一个到的。", "shortMeaning": "他到得最晚。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:59364c5a-4f91-4e22-88d1-360c9a691bf9", "text": "他是最有可能成功的人。", "shortMeaning": "最可能成事的就是他。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:751883b7-b721-4ad1-8955-43ad874a0470", "text": "他是有名的钢琴家。", "shortMeaning": "他是弹钢琴的名家。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:5d2f2b5e-8f5f-4028-901a-e6217fc25466", "text": "他是村子里面唯一在世的人。", "shortMeaning": "村里活着的人只剩他一个。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:a4dacf7e-61be-4945-84d5-21027543d5d8", "text": "他是来问这件事的第几个人？", "shortMeaning": "他是第几个来打听这事的？", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:99ca5b0c-a570-42c3-ad2d-ab2637e09880", "text": "他是泥菩萨过江，自身都难保，哪还有闲暇顾及我们。", "shortMeaning": "他自身都难保，哪还有工夫顾我们。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:40a8338d-39f0-4734-947a-9f94ee952468", "text": "他是班上个子最高的。", "shortMeaning": "班上他个子最高。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:24470f40-b60f-416a-b8f4-0f7eb58d2741", "text": "他是用钢笔写的信。", "shortMeaning": "那封信是他拿钢笔写的。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:7e9f6155-c56a-43ff-9023-b25a5d1ad0ff", "text": "他是由跑步保养青春的活力。", "shortMeaning": "他靠跑步保持年轻的气力。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:54887cf4-d90c-4899-8978-4c4e241b88fe", "text": "他是男孩，她是女孩。", "shortMeaning": "一个是男孩，一个是女孩。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:17a04983-33ea-4f7d-ad5f-656065b0e819", "text": "他是看上了我手上的这个汉堡。", "shortMeaning": "他盯上了我手里的这个汉堡。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:8699e10f-ea9c-4ffc-a6bb-efae10092956", "text": "他是经济学的专家。", "shortMeaning": "他是经济学方面的人。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:8df38364-96cd-4ce3-972e-76db141f87fb", "text": "他是美国大使馆的外交官。", "shortMeaning": "他在美国使馆做外交官。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:670b9c65-fad7-4196-9c9d-05e51fcc3835", "text": "他是老外,他听不懂我们说的话。", "shortMeaning": "他是外国人，听不懂我们的话。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:772a4da0-ab0d-47a5-9f9f-fb1607337e3c", "text": "他是聪明能干的人。", "shortMeaning": "他既聪明又能干。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:3c81951e-d40f-4ce9-b3e5-d61dba77b29b", "text": "他是营销部的负责人。", "shortMeaning": "营销部由他主管。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:4a89e9be-00a5-4b9e-8cd7-8d661dfda507", "text": "他是这个国家的总理。", "shortMeaning": "他是本国的总理。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:d0a01a66-0ef5-4a69-b8aa-4be653b3fa79", "text": "他是这个方面的先锋。", "shortMeaning": "这方面他是开路的人。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:3b863335-fe63-4abb-b4fe-f704ca31de35", "text": "他是这方面的专家，这是肯定的。", "shortMeaning": "这方面他是行家，这一准没错。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:92caad69-53fb-4402-b229-dde9ea11878e", "text": "他是这里附近酒吧和酒馆的常客。", "shortMeaning": "左近的酒吧他都常去。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:4b1f4dba-c41d-4f04-a1b8-818974113dd0", "text": "他是那个职位最有希望的候选人。", "shortMeaning": "那个位子，他最有希望。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:1c819da9-98cd-412a-8a75-48234f47eb99", "text": "他是非常有想像力的作家。", "shortMeaning": "他写东西想头很足。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:75c8ce6c-26ff-445e-aa00-487d496cdba2", "text": "他显摆自己能说6种语言。", "shortMeaning": "他夸口自己会讲六种话。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:5561e6a0-20e8-4e81-9035-26a0d6a0c6b6", "text": "他晚了一分钟错过了火车。", "shortMeaning": "他迟了一分钟，没赶上火车。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:b521f9f7-8a57-439f-a186-3b66d0d12849", "text": "他曾和我们玩过扑克。", "shortMeaning": "他跟我们打过牌。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:1c1ceee1-3bac-446b-8ed4-ccb14911549d", "text": "他曾四次攀登富士山。", "shortMeaning": "富士山他爬过四回。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:aa1217ad-cc02-4691-ad21-b78f2f42eebd", "text": "他曾想获得我的电话号码。", "shortMeaning": "他以前想弄到我的电话。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:5cfc3982-8e90-45af-a3c9-353d00a522bf", "text": "他曾是个英式橄榄球运动员。", "shortMeaning": "他打过橄榄球。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:320e25b2-008c-44ea-9645-3e8fe928a804", "text": "他曾有一头暗棕色的头发。", "shortMeaning": "他原先一头深棕的头发。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:5051c853-617f-4c60-b189-c41c43c36ead", "text": "他曾经被授予金牌。", "shortMeaning": "他曾得过一枚金牌。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:6305f713-0690-4467-9cbf-94a1669df9e0", "text": "他最后一本小说的主题是什么？", "shortMeaning": "他最后一本小说写的是什么题目？", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:7df10d2b-e3b4-4fe2-b7de-a63b257ff429", "text": "他最多能拿到第三名。", "shortMeaning": "他顶多能得第三。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:d7379ffb-f017-4934-a246-d76e63c3bd75", "text": "他最大的缺点就是话太多。", "shortMeaning": "他最大的毛病是话多。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:ce5de5f4-d57c-4221-a610-0c32e73d9724", "text": "他最终同意了我们的计划。", "shortMeaning": "他最后应了我们的方案。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:0b5bc127-7a91-4c2c-9b8e-f609dee3e7d8", "text": "他最终和一个比他小十岁的意大利女人结了婚。", "shortMeaning": "他后来娶了个小他十岁的意大利女子。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:ffa5f35d-b803-4158-888c-7ee4f793c66b", "text": "他最终达成了他的目标。", "shortMeaning": "他到底办成了自己想办的事。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:1895f7f0-da3b-48bb-9ed2-280899aeec67", "text": "他最近几年获得了很多财产。", "shortMeaning": "这几年他挣下了不少家当。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:ab07f7d1-db03-47cd-a9c3-734993dfc0e8", "text": "他有一个兄弟和两个姐妹。", "shortMeaning": "他一个兄弟，两个姐妹。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:d9ab1890-01e3-4470-b121-66aa4cc8084f", "text": "他有一个数学硕士学位。", "shortMeaning": "他读过数学硕士。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:76571330-2cbe-4b26-a16c-26ebc45e1397", "text": "他有一个鸡蛋，他在吃鸡蛋。", "shortMeaning": "他有个鸡蛋，正吃着。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:bc59f7c7-7248-4b89-8387-19384aea9c72", "text": "他有一口滑稽的口音。", "shortMeaning": "他讲话带着古怪的腔。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:a8aa4af5-ceee-4f7a-b1f2-096d188e3931", "text": "他有一张只有母亲爱的脸。", "shortMeaning": "他的长相只有母亲才看得上。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:fd4e0281-2905-458f-8032-1a88e246b786", "text": "他有一条狗和六只猫。", "shortMeaning": "他养一条狗、六只猫。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:d1a9666b-9f2d-4354-aa2a-37afb5f2da0f", "text": "他有一辆蓝色的汽车。", "shortMeaning": "他有辆蓝车。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:f1455f86-7925-4ce8-a4c3-f15de753ad96", "text": "他有三个姐妹，一个在东京，另两个在名古屋。", "shortMeaning": "他三姐妹，一个在东京，两个在名古屋。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:b5e84b03-f81c-43d5-8ce6-c2abd7819ab0", "text": "他有两个女儿都嫁给了医生。", "shortMeaning": "他两个女儿都嫁了大夫。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:97969b41-c30d-4474-9aed-0b45151dfdfb", "text": "他有两个成为了医生的儿子。", "shortMeaning": "他两个儿子都当了医生。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:6389f4cf-3aa4-43f1-bb79-e6b7ec01fec0", "text": "他有个住在东京的兄弟。", "shortMeaning": "他有个兄弟住在东京。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:1d27da5d-4420-49b6-ba99-8595ed5df9af", "text": "他有个装满草莓的篮子。", "shortMeaning": "他有一篮草莓。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:1a5f3871-e1e8-4242-a444-a5c1b9feb57c", "text": "他有个随地吐痰的习惯。", "shortMeaning": "他爱往地上吐痰。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:35b7e177-436a-4074-9528-fc4509bab64e", "text": "他有丰富的从商经验。", "shortMeaning": "他做买卖很有阅历。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:cb28340b-6f51-494f-8afa-5e481d7ffd7a", "text": "他有丰富的经济知识。", "shortMeaning": "他懂不少经济上的门道。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:df431c6b-d692-4fac-ad76-e62b94a4a6f4", "text": "他有五本以上的字典。", "shortMeaning": "他的字典不止五本。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:29b05d0c-acb5-4e85-8991-52042ba2454d", "text": "他有些在日本不能找到的外书。", "shortMeaning": "他有几本日本买不到的外国书。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:337bea7a-bfc7-441d-ac27-e17a1a2cf0b6", "text": "他有些长在耳朵外面的丑陋的汗毛。", "shortMeaning": "他耳朵外边长着难看的毛。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:20f85d40-ae45-4f0d-8b55-338a1197cb31", "text": "他有他的缺点，但是我爱他。", "shortMeaning": "他是有短处，可我仍爱他。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:3efee756-ae87-4ec3-9f63-e1900883a65c", "text": "他有他自己的做法。", "shortMeaning": "他有自己的一套办法。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:2311aeb5-89cc-45ba-ad2b-8df490b4fe7a", "text": "他有可能赢得比赛。", "shortMeaning": "这场比赛他有可能赢。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:f42f76bb-c08a-4f40-9765-0b751eb726d5", "text": "他有各种各样的书。", "shortMeaning": "他什么书都有一些。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:cbe62b01-b012-4b5c-b1d4-a4fc4c96a41c", "text": "他有咬铅笔的毛病。", "shortMeaning": "他爱咬铅笔。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:f07e0cb9-c3b3-433c-aeaa-2ab51e962834", "text": "他有很多兴趣爱好。", "shortMeaning": "他喜好很多。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:a004a0cf-73e3-425d-8db2-35bbb2898750", "text": "他有很多历史书籍。", "shortMeaning": "他史书不少。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:8b751d2a-3653-4388-82da-aeac912cfb60", "text": "他有很多幅名贵的画。", "shortMeaning": "他藏着许多值钱的画。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:df56bb13-1040-4e90-b76e-1700089c66e0", "text": "他有很多新奇的想法。", "shortMeaning": "他满脑子新鲜主意。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:37b0adc7-dc85-41ad-8de5-6248caa7a9a9", "text": "他有很好的幽默感。", "shortMeaning": "他很懂幽默。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:ec3e34b2-1866-4aca-8126-503e839ed865", "text": "他有必要去那里一趟。", "shortMeaning": "他得往那儿走一趟。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:14467afc-0d25-406a-9053-57618ce9a376", "text": "他有抓奇特的飞虫的爱好。", "shortMeaning": "他爱捉些奇怪的飞虫。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:10b39036-348b-4df6-933b-b9684ca6f8d6", "text": "他有时也会很严厉。", "shortMeaning": "他也有厉害的时候。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:2c086185-1f7d-4092-9dd3-d9b4f0cdba64", "text": "他有时会给我写信。", "shortMeaning": "他偶尔给我写信。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:f7fac7d1-284a-46ed-abfa-9cb2abfdfe75", "text": "他有时候会失去希望。", "shortMeaning": "他有时也会没了指望。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:ed1f0d98-de54-4df4-8e3f-234a7c884691", "text": "他有时候会来看我。", "shortMeaning": "他隔三差五来看我一趟。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:312f8e3b-6970-4c9b-b5d2-58e870415aee", "text": "他有时候会睡过头。", "shortMeaning": "他有时一觉睡过了头。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:037d14bb-004f-4361-8f47-d8aa81743fe2", "text": "他有时候会难以清楚地表达他的意见。", "shortMeaning": "他有时说不清自己的意思。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:b8deaa26-17ab-467d-bf79-034ac7c43426", "text": "他有明显的肌肉线条。", "shortMeaning": "他身上的肌肉线条很清楚。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:3421eb3a-21d1-4abe-9c84-ce9f26ee5c03", "text": "他有机会赢得选举吗？", "shortMeaning": "这次选举他有赢头吗？", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:87d7a02e-79a6-4b75-a62c-8d009b2b2d53", "text": "他有权出入美国大使馆。", "shortMeaning": "美国使馆他能随便进出。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:9f982c56-f744-48a7-9025-df3733401a46", "text": "他有杰出的音乐天赋。", "shortMeaning": "他在音乐上天赋出众。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:af6398bf-6285-4dbe-86d4-dbdda25dfbb0", "text": "他有演唱会前排的票。", "shortMeaning": "他手里有演唱会前排的座位票。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:addfba0b-dc64-4a21-bd9c-744e9358cdec", "text": "他有点像他的父亲。", "shortMeaning": "他跟他父亲有些像。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:0f4ca44c-6a05-41e9-8fbd-1aef12c87fc4", "text": "他有点尿急，到处找厕所。", "shortMeaning": "他憋得慌，四处找茅房。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:5b88e230-9340-493c-83d4-fd112a8049ee", "text": "他有着奇妙的想法。", "shortMeaning": "他脑子里有些古怪念头。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:2c2dbfce-8358-42f9-aa59-6cbdffbfcd0b", "text": "他有能力教授西班牙文。", "shortMeaning": "他能教西班牙文。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:4d26f337-7934-4973-9b57-5d239f0387d9", "text": "他有能力比我做得更好。", "shortMeaning": "他能做得比我强。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:083e5c64-621c-4b55-95c0-a7be1d4a2d5c", "text": "他有许多不愉快的经历。", "shortMeaning": "他吃过不少苦头。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:d876fc5b-e623-4982-814e-38e3683635c7", "text": "他有超过一百万美元的资产。", "shortMeaning": "他的家当超过一百万美元。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:7c5d9410-3da9-480d-a767-54e1c79374e3", "text": "他朝狗扔了一块肉。", "shortMeaning": "他把一块肉丢给狗吃。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:91e3bc71-0706-4db9-9bfe-87f31d1b88a7", "text": "他朝着大狗扔了块石头。", "shortMeaning": "他拾起石头朝大狗掷去。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:082a2aa8-111e-44f2-8062-e84d42f115e6", "text": "他朝着狗扔了块石头。", "shortMeaning": "他拿石头砸狗。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:825397fb-c71d-4f7e-aabf-c0610d6504f9", "text": "他朝警卫亮出了一把刀子。", "shortMeaning": "他对着警卫亮出刀来。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:d1048125-99c4-4829-8a11-f073a28cc7d5", "text": "他本希望可以成功，但是他没有。", "shortMeaning": "他原盼着能成，结果没成。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:8b0e46fc-9c45-4522-8d61-58728c9203eb", "text": "他本该买几支钢笔。", "shortMeaning": "他本该买几支笔。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:293be844-8c84-450f-9473-ea8cf9a21e22", "text": "他来不来对我来说没区别。", "shortMeaning": "他来不来我都不在乎。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:cd7e0256-3eb8-473d-85ca-6961d79791ef", "text": "他来了我们就开始。", "shortMeaning": "他一到我们就动手。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:96e5a369-d22f-47ae-a6fd-db11eca9272f", "text": "他来了，我们就开始派对。", "shortMeaning": "他一到，我们就开起聚会。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:20af014e-8c20-4971-92cd-dacd9ebd9178", "text": "他来找你的时候，当时你是什么反应？", "shortMeaning": "他来找你时，你是怎么应的？", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:79863fc4-ec28-4bb7-8723-5f50575f1a5a", "text": "他来找我的时候全身都是酒的味道。", "shortMeaning": "他来找我时满身酒味。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:53b02925-78cf-4d37-a4e7-8d7e0456455d", "text": "他来时她在画玫瑰。", "shortMeaning": "他到的时候，她正在画玫瑰。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:02ffc50d-c360-4c3a-bda2-194347dd1a34", "text": "他来的时候，我们将开始。", "shortMeaning": "等他到了，我们就开始。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:d6e97ef0-a4b7-47a2-922f-c65554235496", "text": "他来的时候，我正在洗澡。", "shortMeaning": "他来那会儿，我正洗着澡。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:47152999-00bc-4c67-8917-75643e7d5021", "text": "他来还是不来，结果是一样的。", "shortMeaning": "他到底来不来，结局都一样。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:4a895404-95e8-42d8-b0f4-26c994d79ab5", "text": "他来这里已经过了一年了。", "shortMeaning": "他来这儿已满一年。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:df9e3baa-f000-459c-907b-417f650d9e73", "text": "他来这里的目的是什么？", "shortMeaning": "他到这儿来图什么？", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:16c6af52-585a-4c18-9d30-1f58e00a09c5", "text": "他根本不想开派对。", "shortMeaning": "他压根不想办聚会。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:3a480836-d555-4515-af64-71e217ef3c84", "text": "他梦想着成为一名英雄。", "shortMeaning": "他梦里都想当英雄。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:030695e1-71ce-44fd-abe3-5fa05a36678f", "text": "他模仿了梵高的作品。", "shortMeaning": "他仿了梵高的画。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:9ced0cc4-6a89-4b76-934c-4eda66115ead", "text": "他正在学怎么开车。", "shortMeaning": "他正学着开车。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:426391a6-882f-4fe2-99d1-828d251fdf34", "text": "他正在思考他未来的生活。", "shortMeaning": "他在想自己往后的日子。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
